%s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfẹ́hìntì lójoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó ṣeé lò fún àwọn èèyàn tó ń ṣe àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù tó lé ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye, awọn agbegbe ati awọn aye ọna asopọ ti iṣeto, pẹlu owo ti o ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bẹ gba awọn eniyan ti o ṣe eyi fun igbesi aye kan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn olómìnira kárí ayé wa: wínilójú lórí ẹgbẹ̀rún mẹ́wàá iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ látọwọ́ àwọn akọ̀wé, apẹ̀rẹ̀, olùgbékalẹ̀ àti àwọn olùgbéga SEO, tàbí kí o gbé iṣẹ́ kalẹ̀ kí o jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún wa ní iye owó.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'O ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso aaye yii.','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, turn on media offload for this site, and paste the pairing code it shows you. No access key is needed — this site never holds one.'=>'Ṣí dáhùn rẹ ti Zinn Digital®, tan iṣẹ́ yíyọ media kúrò fún ojula yii, ki o si lẹ koodu isopọ ti o fihan ọ. Ko si bọtini iwọle ti o nilo — ojula yii ko ni iru rẹ lailai.','Pairing code'=>'Koodu ajọṣepọ','Connect this site'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ ojula yii','Status'=>'Ipò','Connected to your Zinn Digital® account'=>'Ti a sopọ mọ akọọlẹ Zinn Digital® rẹ','Media served from'=>'Ohun elo ti a gba lati','This server (offloaded copies are being kept, but not served yet)'=>'Serva yii (a n tọju awọn ẹ̀dà ti a ti kó kuro, ṣugbọn a ko ti n fi wọn ranṣẹ sibẹsibẹ)','Local copies'=>'Awọn ẹ̀dà abínibí','Removed once every size has uploaded'=>'A yọ kúrò nígbà tí gbogbo ìwọ̀n ti gbe sori ẹ̀rọ náà','Kept on this server'=>'Tọju sori sẹ́bà kọ̀ọ̀kan yìí','Offloaded so far'=>'Ti a gbe jade di oni','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'Awọn faili %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Ṣì wà lórí sẹ́fà yìí','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s ninu %2$s awọn asomọ','Older media moves in the background, a few files an hour, and picks up where it left off. Nothing is deleted from this server unless your dashboard says so.'=>'Àwọn ohun ìgbóhùnsáfẹ́fẹ́ àti ìwé tí ó ti pééjọ́ máa ń lọ ní ìpìlẹ̀, àwọn fáìlì díẹ̀ fún wákàtí kọ̀ọ̀kan, wọ́n sì máa ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti ibi tí wọ́n ti dáwọ́ dúró tẹ́lẹ̀. Kò sí ohun tí a ǹ pa rẹ kúrò lórí sẹ́fà (server) yìí àfi tí bóòdù ìṣàkóso rẹ bá sọ bẹ́ẹ̀.','Last problem'=>'Ìṣòro tó kẹ́yìn','Disconnect this site'=>'Ge aju kuro lori aaye yii','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Àwọn ìgbélékè tuntun yóò wà lórí sínpà (server) yìí. Àwọn ohun amóhùn-máwòrán tí a ti ṣípò tẹ́lẹ̀ yóò máa ṣiṣẹ́ lọ — àdírẹ́sì wọn kì í yí padà.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ẹ lẹ́ koodu ìsopọ̀ láti ojú-iṣẹ́ Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Asopọ ti ni ilọsiwaju. Awọn igo tuntun yoo wa ni ipamọ pẹlu Zinn Digital® lati isinsinyi lọ, ati awọn media ti o wa tẹlẹ yoo gbe lọ ni abẹlẹ.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Kò sopọ̀. Àwọn agbègbè rédíò tí a ti kó lọ tẹ́lẹ̀ máa ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́; àwọn ìgbélékè tuntun wà lórí sẹ́fà yìí.']];